{"arm": "vs", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "i": 3, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Warm editorial: sand-toned paper, serif headlines, and tide-inspired teal and coral accents with a calm, literary rhythm", "probability": 0.3}, {"direction": "Tactile analog: a corkboard or sticky-note weekly board with slightly rotated cards, hand-drawn highlights, and playful texture", "probability": 0.2}, {"direction": "Swiss-style structure: a strict modular grid, high-contrast black and white, monospaced data labels, and a single saturated accent color", "probability": 0.2}, {"direction": "Nocturnal calm: a dark-mode page with soft bioluminescent gradients, a glowing timeline, and low-glare typography for focused planning", "probability": 0.15}, {"direction": "Terminal minimalism: a monospace, keyboard-first aesthetic with command-line motifs, sparse color, and a prompt-style hero", "probability": 0.15}], "pick": {"direction": "Warm editorial: sand-toned paper, serif headlines, and tide-inspired teal and coral accents with a calm, literary rhythm", "probability": 0.3}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Tidepool: Plan your week together</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tidepool helps small teams plan their week together, calmly and on time.\">\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --paper: #f5efe3;\n    --sand: #ebe0cb;\n    --sand-deep: #dccdb0;\n    --ink: #2a2521;\n    --ink-soft: #5d5349;\n    --muted: #8a7d70;\n    --teal: #2e6e6a;\n    --teal-deep: #1d4b48;\n    --teal-wash: #d6e6e1;\n    --coral: #e07a5f;\n    --coral-deep: #c4603f;\n    --coral-wash: #f6d9cc;\n    --rule: rgba(42, 37, 33, 0.14);\n    --serif: \"Iowan Old Style\", \"Palatino Linotype\", Palatino, \"Book Antiqua\", Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --sans: \"Avenir Next\", \"Segoe UI\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    --measure: 40rem;\n    --wrap: 72rem;\n  }\n\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    background-image:\n      radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.55), transparent 45%),\n      radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 60%, rgba(224,122,95,0.07), transparent 40%);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-size: 1.1875rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }\n  a { color: inherit; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 1.1em; }\n\n  .wrap {\n    width: min(var(--wrap), 100% - 3rem);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2, h3 {\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.12;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    margin: 0 0 0.5em;\n  }\n\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.6vw, 4.4rem); }\n  h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.9rem); }\n  h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; }\n\n  h1 em, h2 em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--teal);\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--coral-deep);\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.6rem;\n  }\n  .eyebrow::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    width: 1.75rem;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: currentColor;\n  }\n\n  .lede {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    max-width: 34rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Buttons and links */\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    border: 1.5px solid transparent;\n    transition: background-color .2s ease, color .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .btn-coral { background: var(--coral); color: #fff8f2; }\n  .btn-coral:hover { background: var(--coral-deep); transform: translateY(-1px); }\n  .btn-ghost { border-color: var(--ink); color: var(--ink); background: transparent; }\n  .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }\n  .btn-teal { background: var(--teal); color: #f4fbf9; }\n  .btn-teal:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); }\n\n  .text-link {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--teal-deep);\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: var(--coral);\n    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n    text-underline-offset: 5px;\n  }\n\n  /* Header */\n  .site-header {\n    padding: 1.5rem 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .site-header .wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .brand {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.6rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 1.45rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  }\n  .nav {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 2rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.92rem;\n  }\n  .nav a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .nav a:hover { color: var(--teal-deep); }\n  .nav .btn { padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; font-size: 0.88rem; }\n\n  /* Hero */\n  .hero {\n    padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7.5rem) 0 clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);\n  }\n  .hero-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;\n    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .hero h1 { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }\n  .hero .lede { margin-bottom: 2.25rem; }\n  .cta-row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1.25rem 1.75rem;\n  }\n  .micro {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin-top: 1.5rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Week board mock */\n  .board {\n    background: #fffaf1;\n    border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem 1.6rem;\n    box-shadow:\n      0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8) inset,\n      0 30px 60px -30px rgba(46, 60, 52, 0.35),\n      0 8px 18px -12px rgba(46, 60, 52, 0.25);\n    position: relative;\n    transform: rotate(-0.6deg);\n  }\n  .board-head {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding-bottom: 0.8rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n  }\n  .board-head h3 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n  .board-head span {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  }\n  .days {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  .day {\n    background: var(--sand);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 0.6rem 0.45rem;\n    min-height: 13rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.45rem;\n  }\n  .day-name {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n  }\n  .day.today .day-name { color: var(--coral-deep); }\n  .task {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    padding: 0.45rem 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: #fffaf1;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--teal);\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .task.coral { border-left-color: var(--coral); }\n  .task.sand { border-left-color: var(--muted); }\n  .task b { display: block; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }\n  .task small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.66rem; }\n  .board-foot {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 1.1rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .avatars { display: flex; }\n  .avatars span {\n    width: 1.9rem;\n    height: 1.9rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    font-size: 0.68rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #fff;\n    border: 2px solid #fffaf1;\n    margin-left: -0.4rem;\n  }\n  .avatars span:first-child { margin-left: 0; }\n  .av1 { background: var(--teal); }\n  .av2 { background: var(--coral); }\n  .av3 { background: #7a6a9a; }\n  .av4 { background: #b08a4e; }\n  .sticker {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -1.1rem;\n    right: -0.9rem;\n    background: var(--coral);\n    color: #fff8f2;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.76rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    transform: rotate(4deg);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -10px rgba(196,96,63,0.6);\n  }\n\n  /* Wave dividers */\n  .wave {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: clamp(48px, 7vw, 90px);\n    color: var(--sand);\n  }\n  .wave.flip { transform: scaleY(-1); }\n\n  /* Bands */\n  .band-sand { background: var(--sand); }\n  .band-teal { background: var(--teal-deep); color: #efe7d6; }\n  .band-teal h2, .band-teal h3 { color: #f7efdc; }\n  .band-teal h2 em { color: #f2b39f; }\n  .band-teal .eyebrow { color: #f2b39f; }\n  .band-teal .lede, .band-teal p { color: #d4e2dd; }\n\n  section.block { padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) 0; }\n\n  /* Editorial essay */\n  .essay {\n    max-width: var(--measure);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n  }\n  .essay p { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .essay p.first::first-letter {\n    font-family: var(--serif);\n    float: left;\n    font-size: 4.6rem;\n    line-height: 0.82;\n    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem 0 0;\n    color: var(--coral-deep);\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  .pullquote {\n    margin: 2.75rem 0;\n    padding: 1.5rem 0 1.5rem 1.75rem;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);\n    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);\n    font-style: italic;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    color: var(--teal-deep);\n  }\n  .pullquote cite {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 0.9rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n\n  /* Steps */\n  .section-head {\n    max-width: 44rem;\n    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);\n  }\n  .steps {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);\n  }\n  .steps li {\n    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem 0 0;\n    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    margin-right: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .steps li:last-child { border-right: 0; margin-right: 0; }\n  .step-num {\n    font-size: 3.2rem;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--coral);\n    line-height: 1;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n  }\n  .steps h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; }\n  .steps p {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Feature rows */\n  .feature {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .feature:first-of-type { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }\n  .feature.reverse .feature-art { order: 2; }\n  .feature p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 30rem; }\n  .feature-art {\n    background: var(--sand);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    aspect-ratio: 5 / 4;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .feature-art svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }\n  .feature-tag {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--teal);\n    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  /* Testimonial */\n  .quote-block {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 48rem;\n    margin-inline: auto;\n  }\n  .quote-block blockquote {\n    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;\n    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.4vw, 2.5rem);\n    font-style: italic;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    color: #f7efdc;\n  }\n  .quote-block .who {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    color: #bcd0ca;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n  }\n  .quote-block .who strong { color: #f2b39f; font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* Pricing */\n  .pricing {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    max-width: 52rem;\n    margin-inline: auto;\n  }\n  .plan {\n    background: #fffaf1;\n    border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .plan.featured {\n    border-color: var(--teal);\n    box-shadow: 0 24px 40px -28px rgba(29,75,72,0.6);\n  }\n  .plan-name {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--teal);\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n  }\n  .plan.featured .plan-name { color: var(--coral-deep); }\n  .price {\n    font-size: 3.2rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 0.2rem 0 0.4rem;\n  }\n  .price small {\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .plan .desc { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }\n  .plan ul {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0 0 2rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.93rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .plan li {\n    padding: 0.55rem 0 0.55rem 1.5rem;\n    position: relative;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .plan li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0.1rem;\n    top: 1.02rem;\n    width: 0.5rem;\n    height: 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--teal);\n  }\n  .plan.featured li::before { background: var(--coral); }\n  .plan .btn { text-align: center; }\n\n  /* FAQ */\n  .faq {\n    max-width: var(--measure);\n    margin-inline: auto;\n  }\n  details {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding: 1.2rem 0;\n  }\n  details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }\n  summary {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1rem;\n  }\n  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    color: var(--coral-deep);\n    transition: transform .2s ease;\n  }\n  details[open] summary::after { content: \"\u2013\"; }\n  details p {\n    margin: 0.9rem 0 0;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    max-width: 36rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Final CTA */\n  .final {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 0 clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);\n    background: var(--sand);\n  }\n  .final h2 { max-width: 18ch; margin-inline: auto; }\n  .final .lede { margin: 0 auto 2.25rem; }\n  .final .cta-row { justify-content: center; }\n\n  /* Footer */\n  .site-footer {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #cfc6b8;\n    padding: 3.5rem 0 2.5rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n  }\n  .footer-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 2.5rem;\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n  }\n  .site-footer .brand { color: var(--paper); font-size: 1.3rem; }\n  .site-footer p { color: #a39a8c; max-width: 18rem; margin-top: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }\n  .site-footer h4 {\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #f2b39f;\n    margin: 0 0 1rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .site-footer ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }\n  .site-footer li { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n  .site-footer a { color: #cfc6b8; text-decoration: none; }\n  .site-footer a:hover { color: var(--paper); }\n  .legal {\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    padding-top: 1.5rem;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    color: #8c8374;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Focus */\n  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--coral);\n    outline-offset: 3px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* Responsive */\n  @media (max-width: 960px) {\n    .hero-grid, .feature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .feature.reverse .feature-art { order: 0; }\n    .board { transform: none; max-width: 40rem; }\n    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; border-top: 0; }\n    .steps li {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);\n      border-right: 0;\n      margin-right: 0;\n      padding-right: 1rem;\n      padding-bottom: 2rem;\n    }\n    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 720px) {\n    body { font-size: 1.08rem; }\n    .nav a:not(.btn) { display: none; }\n    .days { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .day { min-height: 0; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; }\n    .day-name { width: 100%; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0; }\n    .day .task { flex: 1 1 10rem; }\n    .pricing { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .steps li { padding-right: 0; }\n    .sticker { right: 0.5rem; }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n    * { transition: none !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a href=\"#top\" class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n      <svg width=\"28\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 22\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M1 7 Q7 1 14 7 T27 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M1 14 Q7 8 14 14 T27 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a5f\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M5 20.5 Q10 16 14 20.5 T23 20.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n      </svg>\n      Tidepool\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n      <a href=\"#how\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"#features\">Features</a>\n      <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">Questions</a>\n      <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"top\">\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">For teams of two to twelve</span>\n        <h1>Plan the week <em>before</em> the week plans you.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Tidepool gives small teams one calm place to sort the week: who is doing what, what needs a second pair of eyes, and what can wait until the tide turns. Five minutes on Monday, and the rest flows.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-row\">\n          <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn-coral\">Plan your first week</a>\n          <a href=\"#how\" class=\"text-link\">See how a week unfolds</a>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"micro\">Free for teams of up to four. No card required.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div aria-label=\"Example week board\">\n        <div class=\"board\">\n          <span class=\"sticker\">Shared on Monday</span>\n          <div class=\"board-head\">\n            <h3>Week of 14 April</h3>\n            <span>5 people \u00b7 18 items</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"days\">\n            <div class=\"day today\">\n              <div class=\"day-name\">Mon</div>\n              <div class=\"task\"><b>Client kickoff</b><small>Priya \u00b7 10:00</small></div>\n              <div class=\"task coral\"><b>Review proposal draft</b><small>Marcus</small></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <div class=\"day-name\">Tue</div>\n              <div class=\"task\"><b>Ship onboarding copy</b><small>Ines</small></div>\n              <div class=\"task sand\"><b>Budget sync</b><small>Open</small></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <div class=\"day-name\">Wed</div>\n              <div class=\"task coral\"><b>Candidate interview</b><small>Tom \u00b7 14:00</small></div>\n              <div class=\"task\"><b>Write the retro</b><small>Priya</small></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <div class=\"day-name\">Thu</div>\n              <div class=\"task\"><b>Design critique</b><small>Ines, Marcus</small></div>\n              <div class=\"task sand\"><b>Vendor follow-up</b><small>Open</small></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <div class=\"day-name\">Fri</div>\n              <div class=\"task coral\"><b>Ship the release</b><small>Team</small></div>\n              <div class=\"task\"><b>Slow hour</b><small>Nobody</small></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"board-foot\">\n            <div class=\"avatars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span class=\"av1\">P</span><span class=\"av2\">M</span><span class=\"av3\">I</span><span class=\"av4\">T</span>\n            </div>\n            <span>3 open items need an owner</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <svg class=\"wave\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 90\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: var(--sand)\">\n    <path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M0,40 C180,90 360,0 540,40 C720,80 900,10 1080,44 C1260,78 1350,30 1440,46 L1440,90 L0,90 Z\"/>\n  </svg>\n\n  <!-- Essay -->\n  <section class=\"block band-sand\" style=\"padding-top: 1rem;\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"essay\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">A small argument</span>\n        <p class=\"first\">Most small teams do not fail at the week. They fail at the Monday before it, when five people each assume someone else has written the list. Messages scatter across threads. A decision made on Tuesday is forgotten by Thursday. Nobody is lazy. The week simply arrived before anyone agreed on its shape.</p>\n        <p>Tidepool treats planning as a shared act, not a private chore. It asks each person for a few honest commitments, puts them where everyone can see, and makes the gaps visible while there is still time to close them. The result is less a schedule than a shared understanding.</p>\n        <blockquote class=\"pullquote\">\n          \u201cWe stopped having the Monday argument. Now we have a Monday coffee and a shared page.\u201d\n          <cite>Ines Carvalho, operations lead at a six-person studio</cite>\n        </blockquote>\n        <p>The tool is deliberately quiet. There are no streaks to protect and no notifications to chase. It shows you what the week asks of you, lets you say what you can carry, and then gets out of the way.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- How it works -->\n  <section class=\"block\" id=\"how\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">How a week unfolds</span>\n        <h2>Four quiet steps, <em>once a week</em>.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">The whole ritual takes about fifteen minutes for a team of five, and most of it happens in parallel.</p>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"steps\">\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"step-num\">i.</span>\n          <h3>Gather what is due</h3>\n          <p>Each person drops in the work already promised, pulled from calendars and open threads.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"step-num\">ii.</span>\n          <h3>Claim your share</h3>\n          <p>Owners attach themselves to items. Anything without a name is visibly unclaimed, not forgotten.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"step-num\">iii.</span>\n          <h3>Name the tide</h3>\n          <p>Mark the moments that will pull on everyone: launches, reviews, and the days that should stay light.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"step-num\">iv.</span>\n          <h3>Read it aloud</h3>\n          <p>Share one page with the team and agree on it. Tidepool records the plan so Friday can be compared with it.</p>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Features -->\n  <section class=\"block band-sand\" id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">What is inside</span>\n        <h2>Less machinery, <em>more shared sense</em>.</h2>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"feature-tag\">Shared week view</span>\n          <h3>One page that everyone can read in a minute.</h3>\n          <p>A single board of five days, arranged the way teams actually think about them. Colour marks what is fixed, what is contested, and what is still open.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 320\">\n            <rect x=\"20\" y=\"30\" width=\"360\" height=\"260\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fffaf1\"/>\n            <g fill=\"#ebe0cb\">\n              <rect x=\"36\" y=\"50\" width=\"62\" height=\"220\" rx=\"10\"/>\n              <rect x=\"106\" y=\"50\" width=\"62\" height=\"220\" rx=\"10\"/>\n              <rect x=\"176\" y=\"50\" width=\"62\" height=\"220\" rx=\"10\"/>\n              <rect x=\"246\" y=\"50\" width=\"62\" height=\"220\" rx=\"10\"/>\n              <rect x=\"316\" y=\"50\" width=\"48\" height=\"220\" rx=\"10\"/>\n            </g>\n            <rect x=\"42\" y=\"72\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffaf1\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <rect x=\"112\" y=\"72\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffaf1\" stroke=\"#e07a5f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <rect x=\"182\" y=\"120\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffaf1\" stroke=\"#e07a5f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <rect x=\"252\" y=\"72\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffaf1\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <rect x=\"252\" y=\"170\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffaf1\" stroke=\"#8a7d70\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <rect x=\"322\" y=\"72\" width=\"36\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f6d9cc\"/>\n            <path d=\"M36 300 Q120 284 200 300 T364 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.45\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feature reverse\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"feature-tag\">Owners, not assignments</span>\n          <h3>Claims instead of commands.</h3>\n          <p>People take on work by naming themselves, which keeps ownership honest. Open items wait, visibly, until someone is ready to carry them.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 320\">\n            <g>\n              <rect x=\"50\" y=\"40\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf1\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"88\" cy=\"70\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#2e6e6a\"/>\n              <text x=\"88\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\">P</text>\n              <rect x=\"120\" y=\"58\" width=\"150\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dccdb0\"/>\n              <rect x=\"120\" y=\"76\" width=\"100\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ebe0cb\"/>\n            </g>\n            <g>\n              <rect x=\"50\" y=\"130\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf1\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"88\" cy=\"160\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#e07a5f\"/>\n              <text x=\"88\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\">M</text>\n              <rect x=\"120\" y=\"148\" width=\"130\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dccdb0\"/>\n              <rect x=\"120\" y=\"166\" width=\"90\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ebe0cb\"/>\n            </g>\n            <g>\n              <rect x=\"50\" y=\"220\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a7d70\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 6\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"88\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a7d70\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n              <text x=\"88\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#8a7d70\">?</text>\n              <rect x=\"120\" y=\"238\" width=\"140\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ebe0cb\"/>\n              <text x=\"120\" y=\"270\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#c4603f\">unclaimed</text>\n            </g>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"feature-tag\">Tide marks</span>\n          <h3>Name the busy days before they arrive.</h3>\n          <p>Mark launches, reviews and deadlines as tide marks. When a day is crowded, Tidepool shows it so the team can move work, not just absorb it.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 320\">\n            <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"360\" height=\"280\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fffaf1\"/>\n            <path d=\"M30 170 Q90 120 150 170 T270 170 T390 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M30 210 Q90 165 150 210 T270 210 T390 210\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a5f\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n            <path d=\"M30 250 Q90 215 150 250 T270 250 T390 250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"104\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#e07a5f\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"90\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2e6e6a\"/>\n            <text x=\"166\" y=\"108\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2a2521\">launch</text>\n            <text x=\"305\" y=\"94\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2a2521\">review</text>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Testimonial -->\n  <section class=\"block band-teal\">\n    <div class=\"wrap quote-block\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">In their words</span>\n      <blockquote>\u201cIt is the first planning tool that made our small team feel like a team, not a list of tickets with names attached.\u201d</blockquote>\n      <p class=\"who\"><strong>Marcus Dube</strong>, founder of a four-person research practice</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Pricing -->\n  <section class=\"block\" id=\"pricing\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-inline: auto;\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Pricing</span>\n        <h2>Simple, <em>for small teams</em>.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-inline:auto;\">Start free and stay free for as long as your team is four or fewer. Pay only when the tide brings more hands.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pricing\">\n        <article class=\"plan\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name\">Shoal</div>\n          <div class=\"price\">$0<small> / forever</small></div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">For teams of up to four who want a calm shared week.</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Unlimited weekly boards</li>\n            <li>Claims and tide marks</li>\n            <li>Four members included</li>\n            <li>Seven days of history</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan featured\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name\">Current</div>\n          <div class=\"price\">$6<small> / person / month</small></div>\n          <p class=\"desc\">For teams of five to twelve who need a longer view.</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Everything in Shoal</li>\n            <li>Up to twelve members</li>\n            <li>Quarterly review of past weeks</li>\n            <li>Guest access for clients</li>\n            <li>Email support within a day</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn btn-coral\">Try Current free for 30 days</a>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section class=\"block band-sand\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-inline:auto;\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Questions</span>\n        <h2>Things people <em>ask first</em>.</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details open>\n          <summary>How long does the weekly planning take?</summary>\n          <p>For a team of five, most people finish their part in about three minutes. The full shared review usually takes fifteen, and it can happen on a short call or asynchronously.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Does Tidepool connect to our calendar?</summary>\n          <p>Yes. You can import events from common calendars to pre-fill the week, but nothing is added or changed without a person confirming it.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>What happens to unclaimed work?</summary>\n          <p>It stays on the board, marked as open, until someone takes it or the team agrees to drop it. Nothing disappears quietly.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Can we keep our existing project tools?</summary>\n          <p>Absolutely. Tidepool is the weekly layer. It links out to the tools you already use and does not ask you to move your work into it.</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Final CTA -->\n  <section class=\"final\" id=\"start\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Monday is coming</span>\n      <h2>Begin the week <em>with a shared page</em>.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Set up a board in a few minutes and invite your team. Your first plan is free, and it will look a little more like yours by Friday.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a href=\"#top\" class=\"btn btn-coral\">Create your board</a>\n        <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Compare plans</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <a href=\"#top\" class=\"brand\">\n          <svg width=\"26\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 22\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M1 7 Q7 1 14 7 T27 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5fa39e\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M1 14 Q7 8 14 14 T27 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e07a5f\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n          Tidepool\n        </a>\n        <p>A calm place for small teams to plan the week ahead, together.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Product</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#how\">How it works</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Company</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#top\">About</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#top\">Journal</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#top\">Contact</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Help</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#faq\">Questions</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#top\">Privacy</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#top\">Terms</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legal\">\n      <span>\u00a9 2025 Tidepool. Made for small teams.</span>\n      <span>Plan gently.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}